<metadata><name>Snowlands 1806 Warren Fork</name><desc>out and back to waypoint 4; side trip from waypoint 3 to 5. Up to 13.2 miles round trip to head of Warren Fork. Add 2.2 miles round trip to Peak 10250.. Line traced from Marcus Libkind's map, tours.snowlands.org/tours/18/1806_tour.htm</desc></metadata>
